// Win32 resources for aip_ui.
//
// The icon is attached to the *executable*, not to any window. That is what Explorer, the taskbar
// and Alt-Tab read, and it is deliberately the only place an icon is declared: the title bars are
// stripped of theirs in window_chrome.cpp. Resource id 1 is not arbitrary -- the shell shows the
// icon with the lowest id, so the application icon has to be the lowest one here.
//
// The path is relative to this file. `target_include_directories` on the target is what puts this
// directory on the resource compiler's search path; without it rc.exe resolves relative to the
// build directory and reports the file as missing.

1 ICON "assets/mixing-table-png.ico"
